    "html_url": "https://github.com/cyjin-yl/qemu-tb371fc/commit/ed43749ccea68fb082db3470f75c061b04ca09c0",
    "message": "tests/tb371fc: assert whole-width DP writeq rejection\n\nThe initial compiled gate passed 17 groups before the isolated-leaf width check incorrectly expected a split 64-bit access. The actual QTest path delivers one size-8 callback. Require its exact rejection, zero register, unchanged complete state, and no hole diagnostic. Preserve the model and all 36-group migration contracts, and retain the failed artifact evidence.",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOV4BGPtoAKGVkNDM3NDljY2VhNjhmYjA4MmRiMzQ3MGY3NWMwNjFiMDRjYTA5YzA",
